      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town moved to its present spot on U.S. Highway 281 when Falcon Dam was completed in 1953.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/ramireno-tx",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Before the move, Ramireno lay two miles south of its current location on the banks of the Rio Grande.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
